{"id":"cristal","lemma":"cristal","pos":"noun","rank":1798,"glosses":["crystal","glass, glassware","window pane"],"ipa":"/kɾisˈtal/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cristales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cristal.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tengo un ojo de cristal.","en":"I have a glass eye.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35304","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"eye"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Este cristal es muy caro, al parecer.","en":"This crystal is very expensive, apparently.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/857870","words":[{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"dear"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"seemingly, apparently"]]},{"text":"La conclusión es clara como el cristal.","en":"The conclusion is crystal clear.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"conclusion, end"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the white"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Tom cree que esos cristales de cuarzo tienen poderes curativos.","en":"Tom believes that these quartz crystals have healing powers.","words":[null,{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"quartz"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},null]},{"text":"El cristal se rompe con facilidad.","en":"Glass breaks easily.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/46095","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to break","l":"romper"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"ease"}]}]}